# Chrysalis

1. **Authoritative rules** are in **`AGENTS.md`**. Read **`DESIGN.md`**, **`docs/STRATEGIC-PLAN.md`** (locked path — do not deviate), and **`ROADMAP.md`** as required there.
2. User messages without **build/implement/add/fix** are usually **questions** — clarify against the strategic plan; do not fork unless the user explicitly amends the plan.
3. After substantive changes, run **`pnpm test`** (or the smallest relevant package tests). Respect package boundaries (no circular dependencies; no oracle or environment shortcuts in generated or verify code).
